WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.640 align:middle line:90%

2
00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:02.710 align:middle line:84%
I've got a project
that I need to rename.

3
00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:04.810 align:middle line:84%
To do that, I'll
open the project,

4
00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:08.020 align:middle line:84%
and then click on the Project
Settings link in the top right.

5
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.300 align:middle line:84%
I'm looking for the header
that says project name.

6
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.500 align:middle line:90%
That's here.

7
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.930 align:middle line:84%
Just enter the new
name, and then scroll

8
00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:16.690 align:middle line:84%
down to the Save button
at the bottom of the page.

9
00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:17.650 align:middle line:90%
And that's it.

10
00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:21.150 align:middle line:84%
The project's renamed to
exactly what I need it.
